# Keep everything LF in the repository so the Linux CI runner and Windows
# checkouts agree. Chrome reads the built files, not these, so this only
# affects diffs and tooling.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Images must never be line-ending "fixed". Git's auto-detection would
# almost certainly classify these as binary anyway, but saying so explicitly
# means a demo GIF cannot be corrupted by a checkout on another platform.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
